Ringling College of Art and Design. Now

3
00:00:15,519 --> 00:00:17,520
that we've explored what AI fluency

4
00:00:17,520 --> 00:00:19,279
means and the different ways we interact

5
00:00:19,279 --> 00:00:21,920
with AI, let's dive into the core

6
00:00:21,920 --> 00:00:24,160
competencies that help us navigate AI

7
00:00:24,160 --> 00:00:26,640
collaboration effectively, efficiently,

8
