9
00:00:29,039 --> 00:00:30,800
No matter how you're working with AI,

10
00:00:30,800 --> 00:00:32,079
whether through automation,

11
00:00:32,079 --> 00:00:34,800
augmentation, or agency, there are four

12
00:00:34,800 --> 00:00:37,800
essential competencies that make all the

13
00:00:37,800 --> 00:00:41,000
difference. We call them the four Ds:

14
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:43,520
delegation, description, discernment,

15
00:00:43,520 --> 00:00:46,399
and diligence. First is delegation,

16
00:00:46,399 --> 00:00:49,239
which focuses on the big

17
00:00:49,239 --> 00:00:51,360
picture. What are you trying to

18
00:00:51,360 --> 00:00:53,440
accomplish? What kinds of work are

19
00:00:53,440 --> 00:00:55,680
involved? What work should you handle

20
00:00:55,680 --> 00:00:58,960
yourself? And where might AI be helpful?

21
00:00:58,960 --> 00:01:00,640
Think about a research project you're

22
00:01:00,640 --> 00:01:02,399
working on. You might decide to have

23
00:01:02,399 --> 00:01:04,320
your AI assistant review lengthy

24
00:01:04,320 --> 00:01:06,479
documents and data, then engage in a

25
00:01:06,479 --> 00:01:07,760
thoughtful discussion about the

26
00:01:07,760 --> 00:01:10,080
implications and findings, but reserve

27
00:01:10,080 --> 00:01:11,920
the critical analysis and final

28
00:01:11,920 --> 00:01:13,720
conclusions for

29
00:01:13,720 --> 00:01:16,479
yourself. To delegate effectively, you

30
00:01:16,479 --> 00:01:18,880
need to understand your goal and the

31
00:01:18,880 --> 00:01:21,439
problem you're solving. Recognize what

32
00:01:21,439 --> 00:01:25,040
AI can and can't do well. And lastly,

33
00:01:25,040 --> 00:01:28,119
thoughtfully divide the work between you
and the

34
00:01:28,119 --> 00:01:30,560
AI. Delegation isn't just about

35
00:01:30,560 --> 00:01:32,799
offloading tasks. It's about having a

36
00:01:32,799 --> 00:01:34,799
clear vision and strategically choosing

37
00:01:34,799 --> 00:01:38,079
how AI fits into your process. This

38
00:01:38,079 --> 00:01:39,759
thoughtful approach is essential for

39
00:01:39,759 --> 00:01:43,000
both effective and efficient AI

40
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:45,360
collaboration. Next comes description,

41
00:01:45,360 --> 00:01:47,600
which focuses on clear communication

42
00:01:47,600 --> 00:01:50,799
with AI. Consider the difference between

43
00:01:50,799 --> 00:01:53,040
vaguely stating, "Make me a logo."

44
00:01:53,040 --> 00:01:55,360
versus describing your company's values,

45
00:01:55,360 --> 00:01:57,360
target audience, preferred colors, style

46
00:01:57,360 --> 00:02:00,159
references, and so on. Or if you're

47
00:02:00,159 --> 00:02:02,240
using an AI as a tutor, you might take

48
00:02:02,240 --> 00:02:04,479
the extra step to specify, "Don't tell

49
00:02:04,479 --> 00:02:06,240
me the answer, just help me work through

50
00:02:06,240 --> 00:02:08,000
this problem step by step so I can

51
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:10,399
better understand the concept."

52
00:02:10,399 --> 00:02:12,239
Description goes beyond just writing

53
00:02:12,239 --> 00:02:14,760
prompts. It's about having detailed,

54
00:02:14,760 --> 00:02:18,319
contextrich conversations that establish

55
00:02:18,319 --> 00:02:20,080
what you're hoping to achieve in the

56
00:02:20,080 --> 00:02:23,280
format of the output, how you want the

57
00:02:23,280 --> 00:02:26,480
AI to approach the task, the context and

58
00:02:26,480 --> 00:02:28,319
information that the AI might need to

59
00:02:28,319 --> 00:02:31,120
best work with you on this task, and the

60
00:02:31,120 --> 00:02:34,640
tone and style of interaction.

61
00:02:34,640 --> 00:02:36,640
Effective description means articulating

62
00:02:36,640 --> 00:02:38,879
your needs and vision in a way that sets

63
00:02:38,879 --> 00:02:41,519
up both you and the AI for greatest

64
00:02:41,519 --> 00:02:43,239
collaborative

65
00:02:43,239 --> 00:02:46,480
success. The third D is discernment,

66
00:02:46,480 --> 00:02:48,720
which involves thoughtfully evaluating

67
00:02:48,720 --> 00:02:51,599
what AI gives you. Let's say you've

68
00:02:51,599 --> 00:02:53,840
asked an AI assistant to suggest a

69
00:02:53,840 --> 00:02:56,080
marketing strategy. Your discernment

70
00:02:56,080 --> 00:02:58,800
comes into play as you assess, are the

71
00:02:58,800 --> 00:03:01,519
facts accurate? Does the reasoning make

72
00:03:01,519 --> 00:03:04,159
sense? Do the recommendations align with

73
00:03:04,159 --> 00:03:06,840
your brand values and audience? And most

74
00:03:06,840 --> 00:03:09,599
importantly, does this output actually

75
00:03:09,599 --> 00:03:12,560
help you move forward? Discernment draws

76
00:03:12,560 --> 00:03:15,040
upon your own expertise in a domain and

77
00:03:15,040 --> 00:03:16,879
requires developing the judgment and

78
00:03:16,879 --> 00:03:18,640
critical insight to separate what's

79
00:03:18,640 --> 00:03:20,959
useful from what's not and to recognize

80
00:03:20,959 --> 00:03:23,280
when AI outputs need refinement or

81
00:03:23,280 --> 00:03:25,920
should be set aside entirely. Most of

82
00:03:25,920 --> 00:03:28,000
our interactions with AI involve small

83
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:30,159
loops of description and discernment,

84
00:03:30,159 --> 00:03:32,159
describing what we need, evaluating what

85
00:03:32,159 --> 00:03:35,280
we get, refining our request, and so on.

86
00:03:35,280 --> 00:03:37,280
We'll explore this more deeply later in

87
00:03:37,280 --> 00:03:40,319
the course. Finally, there's diligence,

88
00:03:40,319 --> 00:03:42,640
which focuses on responsible AI

89
00:03:42,640 --> 00:03:44,239
interactions.

90
00:03:44,239 --> 00:03:46,400
For example, if you are using AI to help

91
00:03:46,400 --> 00:03:47,959
write job descriptions or review

92
00:03:47,959 --> 00:03:49,920
applications, how are you ensuring

93
00:03:49,920 --> 00:03:52,840
fairness and controlling for potential

94
00:03:52,840 --> 00:03:55,440
biases? When making important decisions

95
00:03:55,440 --> 00:03:57,680
with AI assistance, how are you

96
00:03:57,680 --> 00:03:59,360
verifying the accuracy of the

97
00:03:59,360 --> 00:04:01,519
information presented to you? Are you

98
00:04:01,519 --> 00:04:03,760
protecting sensitive data? Have you

99
00:04:03,760 --> 00:04:05,599
considered how to be transparent about

100
00:04:05,599 --> 00:04:08,640
the involvement of AI? Are you willing

101
00:04:08,640 --> 00:04:11,040
to be accountable for the AI assisted

102
00:04:11,040 --> 00:04:13,120
work you have done?

103
00:04:13,120 --> 00:04:15,200
Diligence means taking ownership of your

104
00:04:15,200 --> 00:04:17,359
AI assisted work and being willing to

105
00:04:17,359 --> 00:04:19,600
stand behind final products created

106
00:04:19,600 --> 00:04:23,840
using AI. Diligence is critical for safe

107
00:04:23,840 --> 00:04:26,919
and ethical AI

108
00:04:26,919 --> 00:04:29,680
collaboration. To recap, AI fluency

109
00:04:29,680 --> 00:04:31,440
means developing practical skills,

110
00:04:31,440 --> 00:04:33,280
knowledge, insights, and values that

111
00:04:33,280 --> 00:04:34,960
help you use AI effectively,

112
00:04:34,960 --> 00:04:38,160
efficiently, ethically, and safely. AI

113
00:04:38,160 --> 00:04:40,600
fluency includes four key

114
00:04:40,600 --> 00:04:43,040
competencies. Delegation to decide when

115
00:04:43,040 --> 00:04:46,160
and how to use AI, description to

116
00:04:46,160 --> 00:04:49,040
communicate clearly with AI, discernment

117
00:04:49,040 --> 00:04:52,240
to evaluate AI outputs, and diligence to

118
00:04:52,240 --> 00:04:55,040
use AI responsibly. What makes these

119
00:04:55,040 --> 00:04:57,040
competencies so valuable is that they

120
00:04:57,040 --> 00:04:59,040
aren't tied to specific AI tools or

121
00:04:59,040 --> 00:05:01,520
techniques that might become outdated.

122
00:05:01,520 --> 00:05:04,160
Instead, they're fundamental skills that

123
00:05:04,160 --> 00:05:06,639
will help you adapt and grow alongside

124
00:05:06,639 --> 00:05:11,080
this rapidly evolving technology.
